above 1.', '{"level":1,"school":"Enchantment","casting_time":"Action","range":"30 feet","components":"V, S, M (a drop of blood)","duration":"Concentration, up to 1 minute","classes":["bard","cleric","warlock"],"is_ritual":false,"requires_concentration":true}'::jsonb, null),
  ('dnd5e-2024', 'spell', 'Banishment', 'banishment', null, 'One creature that you can see within range must
succeed on a Charisma saving throw or be trans-
ported to a harmless demiplane for the duration.
While there, the target has the Incapacitated con-
dition. When the spell ends, the target reappears in
