Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. You can target
one additional creature for each spell slot level
above 4.', '{"level":4,"school":"Abjuration","casting_time":"Action","range":"30 feet","components":"V, S, M (a pentacle)","duration":"Concentration, up to 1 minute","classes":["cleric","paladin","sorcerer","warlock","wizard"],"is_ritual":false,"requires_concentration":true}'::jsonb, null),
  ('dnd5e-2024', 'spell', 'Barkskin', 'barkskin', null, 'You touch a willing creature. Until the spell ends,
the target''s skin assumes a bark-like appearance,
