lower than that.', '{"level":2,"school":"Transmutation","casting_time":"Bonus Action","range":"Touch","components":"V, S, M (a handful of bark)","duration":"1 hour","classes":["druid","ranger"],"is_ritual":false,"requires_concentration":false}'::jsonb, null),
  ('dnd5e-2024', 'spell', 'Beacon of Hope', 'beacon-of-hope', null, 'Choose any number of creatures within range. For
