In addition, whenever a creature within 5 feet
of you hits you with a melee attack roll, the shield
erupts with flame. The attacker takes 2d8 Fire dam-
age from a warm shield or 2d8 Cold damage from a
chill shield.', '{"level":4,"school":"Evocation","casting_time":"Action","range":"Self","components":"V, S, M (a bit of phosphorus or a firefly)","duration":"10 minutes","classes":["druid","sorcerer","wizard"],"is_ritual":false,"requires_concentration":false}'::jsonb, null),
  ('dnd5e-2024', 'spell', 'Fire Storm', 'fire-storm', null, 'A storm of fire appears within range. The area of
