number of Hit Points equal to 2d8 plus the spell''s level.', '{"level":3,"school":"Evocation","casting_time":"Action","range":"150 feet","components":"V, S, M (a ball of bat guano and sulfur)","duration":"Instantaneous","classes":["sorcerer","wizard"],"is_ritual":false,"requires_concentration":false}'::jsonb, null),
  ('dnd5e-2024', 'spell', 'Flame Blade', 'flame-blade', null, 'You evoke a fiery blade in your free hand. The blade
is similar in size and shape to a scimitar, and it lasts
