The cloud moves 10 feet away from you in a direc-
tion you choose at the start of each of your turns.', '{"level":8,"school":"Conjuration","casting_time":"Action","range":"150 feet","components":"V, S","duration":"Concentration, up to 1 minute","classes":["druid","sorcerer","wizard"],"is_ritual":false,"requires_concentration":true}'::jsonb, null),
  ('dnd5e-2024', 'spell', 'Inflict Wounds', 'inflict-wounds', null, 'A creature you touch makes a Constitution saving
