Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage in-
creases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 5.', '{"level":5,"school":"Conjuration","casting_time":"Action","range":"300 feet","components":"V, S, M (a locust)","duration":"Concentration, up to 10 minutes","classes":["cleric","druid","sorcerer"],"is_ritual":false,"requires_concentration":true}'::jsonb, null),
  ('dnd5e-2024', 'spell', 'Instant Summons', 'instant-summons', null, 'You touch the sapphire used in the casting and an
