When you cast the spell, a loud knock, audible up
to 300 feet away, emanates from the target.', '{"level":2,"school":"Transmutation","casting_time":"Action","range":"60 feet","components":"V","duration":"Instantaneous","classes":["bard","sorcerer","wizard"],"is_ritual":false,"requires_concentration":false}'::jsonb, null),
  ('dnd5e-2024', 'spell', 'Legend Lore', 'legend-lore', null, 'Name or describe a famous person, place, or object.
