As a Bonus Action on your later turns, you can
move the force up to 20 feet and repeat the attack
against a creature within 5 feet of it.
Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage in-
creases by 1d8 for every slot level above 2.', '{"level":2,"school":"Evocation","casting_time":"Bonus Action","range":"60 feet","components":"V, S","duration":"Concentration, up to 1 minute","classes":["cleric"],"is_ritual":false,"requires_concentration":true}'::jsonb, null),
  ('dnd5e-2024', 'spell', 'Starry Wisp', 'starry-wisp', null, 'You launch a mote of light at one creature or object
within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the
